        "guid": "c16569f5-02ed-4d6a-bbdb-649455e512d5",
        "name": "Progress Sync",
        "description": "Adds a \"Sync progress\" button to movie, series, season and episode pages, watch status on movie and episode pages, a watch history dashboard, separate playback-limits and progress-sync tabs, server-enforced per-user and scheduled media visibility, and per-user concurrent playback limits. Copy another user's resume position and watched state to your account once, or link a movie or series to keep it in sync (follow or two-way). Requires the File Transformation plugin.\n",
        "overview": "Sync progress, browse watch history, and manage media visibility between users",
        "owner": "liamfo993",
        "category": "General",
